<#f0f000>Movelist :</>

<#f0f000>Information:</>

Ex-Aid has an XP bar that will slowly go up
throughout the match. Pressing ^C will charge it
up, though this charge does not increase meter.
The XP bar also goes up when supers are used.
When the XP bar is full press ^Z to Level up.

Levels go from:

<#ff0000>Level 1</> Intro only

Level 2 The default mode

<#ff10db>Level Max</> Gain access to more specials/supers

<#ffff00>Hyper Muteki</> Gain access to Hyper Muteki moves

<#f0f000>Basics:</>

Run					_F_F
Back Hop				_B_B
Super Jump				_D_U
Air Recover				^A+^B
Dodge Forwards				^X+^A
(Dodge gets buffed in Muteki)
Burst				^X+^Y
(Usable once per match, use wisely)

Light Punch				^X
Heavy Punch				^Y
Light Kick				^A
Heavy Kick				^B

Low Light Punch				^A (crouch)
Low Heavy Punch				^Y (crouch)
Low Light Kick				^A (crouch)
Low Sweep				^B (crouch)
(Knocks Down)

Aerial Light Punch				^A (air)
Aerial Heavy Punch				^Y (air)
Aerial Light Kick				^A (air)
Aerial Heavy Kick				^B (air)

Grab					[_B/_F]_+^Y (When Close)

<#f0f000>Unique Moves:</>

Sword Swing				_F^X+^Y
XP Charge				^C
Level Up				^Z
(When the XP bar is full)

<#f0f000>Special Attacks:</>

Level 2:

Gekitotsu Punch				_D_DF_F^X / _D_DF_F^Y
(^Y fires twice and knocks down)

Gekitotsu Buster				_D_DB_B^X / _D_DB_B^Y
(^Y covers more distance and knocks down while
being less safe)

Dragonite Hunter				_D_DF_F^A / _D_DF_F^B
(Can be used in the air)

Shakariki Sports				_D_DB_B^A / _D_DB_B^B
(^A hits once and has upper body invincibility. While ^Y
Hits twice and is more suitable for combos)

<#ff10db>Level Max:</>

Maximum Knuckle				_B_DB_D_DF_F^Y
(Armored, usable once per combo. Do the same command
on hit for a followup)

Sword Dive				_D_DF_F^X / _D_DF_F^Y (air)

<#ffff00>Hyper Muteki:</>

Guard Cancel				_B^A+^B
(Requires Half XP & 1500 Power to use, Usable 2 times per
round. This move cannot kill)

<#f0f000>Super Attacks:</>

Level 2:

Critical Strike (1 Bar)				_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A
Action Bike (1 Bar)				_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^X
Mighty Brothers (2 Bars)				_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A

<#ff10db>Level Max:</>

Maximum Mighty Critical Strike (2 Bars)				_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^Y
Maximum Mighty Critical Break (3 Bars)				_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^B

<#ffff00>Hyper Muteki:</>

Hyper Critical Sparkling (3 Bars)				_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^B
(The XP Bar must be full in order to use and Emu needs
to be under 300 HP as well)